WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.525 --> 00:00:14.932
The guard took the children to the palace.

2
00:00:16.213 --> 00:00:21.236
Vinnie and Mandy were scared, but they had never seen a place so grand.

3
00:00:22.496 --> 00:00:24.998
There were so many courtyards and fountains.

4
00:00:26.599 --> 00:00:28.360
Everything glittered with gold.

5
00:00:32.360 --> 00:00:33.581
"This place is big!"

6
00:00:34.101 --> 00:00:34.821
said Vinnie.

7
00:00:34.841 --> 00:00:38.563
"Bigger than Versailles," Mandy added.

8
00:00:39.663 --> 00:00:42.304
Two more guards came out of a palace gate.

9
00:00:43.825 --> 00:00:47.186
They walked over to the guard who was holding the children.

10
00:00:48.226 --> 00:00:50.647
All the guards began whispering at once.

11
00:00:51.788 --> 00:00:53.308
Their faces were angry.

12
00:00:53.328 --> 00:00:56.570
"It is time," said one guard.

13
00:00:56.590 --> 00:01:02.032
"We hoped the sultan would raise our pay," said another guard.

14
00:01:03.176 --> 00:01:05.217
"But he only cares about his own riches."

15
00:01:05.237 --> 00:01:09.378
"We have no choice," said the first guard.

16
00:01:09.398 --> 00:01:10.918
"We must act!"

17
00:01:11.979 --> 00:01:15.439
The guards huddled together, and the children were forgotten.

18
00:01:17.100 --> 00:01:17.700
"Come on!"

19
00:01:18.280 --> 00:01:18.980
cried Vinnie.

20
00:01:19.381 --> 00:01:20.901
He pulled his sister's arm.

21
00:01:20.921 --> 00:01:23.022
"Let's get out of here!"

22
00:01:24.322 --> 00:01:26.663
The children ran into a nearby building.

23
00:01:27.783 --> 00:01:31.264
It was a huge kitchen made up of ten large rooms.

24
00:01:32.380 --> 00:01:34.242
Each room had a tall chimney.

25
00:01:34.262 --> 00:01:36.884
"This is a kitchen?"

26
00:01:37.464 --> 00:01:38.885
Vinnie said, amazed.

27
00:01:40.126 --> 00:01:42.027
Many people were rushing around.

28
00:01:43.268 --> 00:01:46.691
Everyone was busy cooking, washing, or chopping.

29
00:01:46.711 --> 00:01:50.334
"How many people do you cook for?"

30
00:01:50.854 --> 00:01:52.375
Mandy asked a young cook.

31
00:01:53.516 --> 00:01:54.657
He wiped his face.

32
00:01:54.677 --> 00:01:58.460
"Over four thousand people," he replied.

33
00:01:59.688 --> 00:02:02.589
"Sometimes, we cook six thousand meals a day."

34
00:02:03.969 --> 00:02:05.690
Mandy could not believe it.

35
00:02:06.950 --> 00:02:08.831
"Look at all those dishes!"

36
00:02:09.451 --> 00:02:10.111
she cried.

37
00:02:11.391 --> 00:02:14.912
Then she saw more Janissary guards entering the kitchen.

38
00:02:16.253 --> 00:02:17.833
They looked very angry.

39
00:02:18.333 --> 00:02:19.213
She poked Vinnie.

40
00:02:19.233 --> 00:02:21.994
"Vinnie! They found us!"

41
00:02:22.854 --> 00:02:24.315
Mandy pointed at the door.

42
00:02:24.335 --> 00:02:26.716
"What should we do?"

43
00:02:27.316 --> 00:02:30.021
she whispered, looking for a place to hide.

44
00:02:31.082 --> 00:02:32.823
But the guards ignored the children.

45
00:02:33.724 --> 00:02:36.146
Instead, they picked up big pots.

46
00:02:37.407 --> 00:02:39.268
The kitchen workers looked frightened.

47
00:02:39.288 --> 00:02:41.430
"What's happening?"

48
00:02:42.150 --> 00:02:43.691
Vinnie asked one of the cooks.

49
00:02:45.132 --> 00:02:47.554
Each guard was carrying a large pot.

50
00:02:48.855 --> 00:02:52.778
The leader of the guards called out, "We will make the sultan listen!"

51
00:02:56.292 --> 00:02:59.913
All the guards cheered loudly and marched from the kitchen.

52
00:02:59.933 --> 00:03:02.294
"Where are they going?"

53
00:03:02.874 --> 00:03:04.094
Mandy asked the cook.

54
00:03:05.274 --> 00:03:07.415
"They want more money," said the cook.

55
00:03:08.415 --> 00:03:11.316
"The guards have been angry with the sultan for a long time.

56
00:03:12.516 --> 00:03:14.937
They want the sultan to fill the pots with gold."

57
00:03:16.017 --> 00:03:18.538
People started shouting throughout the palace.

58
00:03:18.558 --> 00:03:21.359
"Mandy, let's go!"

59
00:03:21.899 --> 00:03:22.699
cried Vinnie.

60
00:03:23.879 --> 00:03:25.800
The children ran out of the kitchen.

61
00:03:26.888 --> 00:03:31.672
They followed the Janissary up some marble steps and through a large door.

62
00:03:33.034 --> 00:03:36.597
Soon, Vinnie and Mandy were in a big colorful room.

63
00:03:38.198 --> 00:03:43.783
A man wearing a turban with a white feather sat on a red throne just inside.

64
00:03:43.803 --> 00:03:47.947
"That must be the sultan," cried Mandy.

65
00:03:47.967 --> 00:03:49.968
"We can't stay.

66
00:03:50.389 --> 00:03:53.872
Let's get out of here and find a way back home," said Vinnie.

67
00:03:55.484 --> 00:03:59.326
The children ran out of the throne room and into a courtyard.

68
00:04:00.386 --> 00:04:03.547
"I hope you know where you're going," Mandy said.

69
00:04:03.567 --> 00:04:08.009
"Don't worry, Mandy" said Vinnie as they ran.

70
00:04:09.110 --> 00:04:11.331
Soon they were outside of the palace.

71
00:04:11.351 --> 00:04:14.032
"Look! Over there!"

72
00:04:14.592 --> 00:04:15.412
Vinnie pointed.

73
00:04:16.493 --> 00:04:18.154
Another mosque was nearby.

74
00:04:19.154 --> 00:04:21.255
The dome shone brightly in the sun.

75
00:04:22.495 --> 00:04:23.836
Vinnie took out the photo.

76
00:04:24.444 --> 00:04:25.645
It was glowing blue.

77
00:04:25.665 --> 00:04:31.589
"Four towers he said, counting the towers around the mosque.

78
00:04:32.730 --> 00:04:35.311
Then, the photo started to glow red.

79
00:04:35.332 --> 00:04:39.414
"Mandy, this is it!"

80
00:04:40.055 --> 00:04:41.916
Vinnie grabbed his sister's hand.

81
00:04:41.936 --> 00:04:44.778
"We're really going home!"
